<title>USA: Cell Genesys says registration effective.</title>
<headline>Cell Genesys says registration effective.</headline>
<dateline>FOSTER CITY, Calif 1997-05-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cell Genesys Inc said its registration statement for its proposed merger with Somatix Therapy Corp was declared effective by the Securities and Exchange Commission (SEC).</p>
<p>The stockholders meetings to approve the merger are scheduled for May 30, it said.</p>
